{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016qwjYggmJ3Tg7JcFamXfAq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# AGENTS.md\n2\t\n3\tThe contributor guide for **this meta-repo** is [`CLAUDE.md`](CLAUDE.md) — read\n4\tit first. It governs editing the reusable kit in\n5\t[`project-trajectory/`](project-trajectory/). This stub exists so agents that\n6\tread `AGENTS.md` (Codex and others) land on that guide too; the content lives in\n7\t`CLAUDE.md`, not here.\n8\t\n9\t> Note: the kit *ships* the inverse convention — downstream projects get a full\n10\t> `AGENTS.md` with `CLAUDE.md`/`GEMINI.md` stubs. Here `CLAUDE.md` is the home\n11\t> because that's the historical guide for this repo; this `AGENTS.md` dogfoods\n12\t> the cross-tool pointer pattern.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"267b44f8-10d1-4792-a138-7aadcbbf083b","uuid":"22dd3bcf-c772-4ec7-ada6-ff73fb28d0ba","timestamp":"2026-07-23T17:53:00.611Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Projects\\ai-template-trains\\p0-g3-WI-276-dec8\\AGENTS.md","content":"# AGENTS.md\n\nThe contributor guide for **this meta-repo** is [`CLAUDE.md`](CLAUDE.md) — read\nit first. It governs editing the reusable kit in\n[`project-trajectory/`](project-trajectory/). This stub exists so agents that\nread `AGENTS.md` (Codex and others) land on that guide too; the content lives in\n`CLAUDE.md`, not here.\n\n> Note: the kit *ships* the inverse convention — downstream projects get a full\n> `AGENTS.md` with `CLAUDE.md`/`GEMINI.md` stubs. Here `CLAUDE.md` is the home\n> because that's the historical guide for this repo; this `AGENTS.md` dogfoods\n> the cross-tool pointer pattern.\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}}}
